# =============================================================================
# What this repo tracks vs. generates
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# TRACK (source of truth):
#   - each module's .setup / .solution.sh scripts
#   - exercise data with no generator: 1.6/probes/*, 1.7/results/*.tsv.gz
#   - scripts/, docs/ (the Pages site), README.md
#
# IGNORE (produced at stage time by a .setup, or downloaded): everything below.
# The .setup scripts regenerate the student-facing trees on the HPC; never
# commit those, and never commit large downloaded installers/containers.
# Patterns are path-agnostic so they apply whether a .setup is run inside its
# module dir or (accidentally) at the repo root.
# =============================================================================

# --- OS / editor cruft ---
.DS_Store
*.swp
*~

# --- 1.5 navigation hint-chain (generated by 1.5/.setup) ---
data/
projects/
analysis_scripts/
hint
.hint
Secret Stuff/

# --- 1.6 file-manipulation trees (generated by 1.6/.setup) ---
raw_data/
expt1/
expt2/
expt3/
exercise

# --- 1.9 / containers / conda: downloaded, never committed ---
Miniforge3-*.sh
cellranger-*.tar.gz
*.sif
env.yml
